+// DMR AES voice in the Motorola layout (CONFIG_AIR_AES with CONFIG_DMR_PRIVACY; docs/spec/air-encryption.md 8).
+// A PI header (FID 0x10) carries the algorithm, an 8-bit key ID and a 32-bit MI. The MI and the LFSR
+// x^32 + x^22 + x^2 + x + 1 give the 128-bit IV; AES OFB, first block discarded, gives 126 octets a superframe:
